172 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 129 0 R
/E (Our work is guided by the Sustainable Development Goals \(SDGs\), with a focus on gender equality, good health and well-being, clean water and sanitation, economic development, and peace, justice, and strong institutions. To achieve these goals, we work at the community level to develop Gender Development Plans. Community participation is ensured through the formation of core committees, whose members are provided with training and exposure visits to help them understand their rights and responsibilities. This has encouraged problem-solving and increased ownership at the community level. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
173 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 129 0 R
/E (This strategy bore fruit when we successfully initiated a Water Irrigation Program in the Morvan forest area near Safale in Palghar district. This project became a highlight of our interventions this year, with active participation from villagers. It helped build community confidence and empowered some villagers to raise their voices in Gram Panchayat meetings, with a few becoming members of the PESA committee.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
