213 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 133 0 R
/E (The immediate impact of the session was the awareness it created among the girls about various avenues for saving and investing. By making them aware of various government schemes, the session empowered them with the knowledge to make informed decisions about their future. Furthermore, the interactive nature of the session, through discussions and games, enhanced their understanding of financial management, which is expected to have a long-term positive impact on their lives.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
214 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 133 0 R
/E (The financial literacy program resulted in a significant increase in participants' knowledge and confidence regarding financial concepts, enabling them to engage more effectively with the community women. Staff and volunteers developed stronger relationships, fostering open discussions about financial management. Additionally, the initiative heightened awareness of financial resources among tribal women, promoting a culture of financial literacy and proactive management. Overall, the program empowered participants with practical skills that contribute to the economic independence of tribal women, enhancing their ability to make informed financial decisions.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
