<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 137 0 R
/T (Anita was facing domestic violence as her husband was involved in an extramarital affair. The emotional and psychological abuse, coupled with the constant turmoil in their relationship, led her to seek help from Sakhya's Lawyer. With the support of counselling provided by Sakhya's lawyer, Anita and her husband managed to reconcile and try to live together again. However, despite their efforts, the situation deteriorated further when her husband refused to end the affair, and his behavior became more abusive and troubling.)
/E (Anita was facing domestic violence as her husband was involved in an extramarital affair. The emotional and psychological abuse, coupled with the constant turmoil in their relationship, led her to seek help from Sakhya's Lawyer. With the support of counselling provided by Sakhya's lawyer, Anita and her husband managed to reconcile and try to live together again. However, despite their efforts, the situation deteriorated further when her husband refused to end the affair, and his behavior became more abusive and troubling.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
276 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 137 0 R
/T (In response to this ongoing abuse, Sakhya's Lawyer applied for the Protection Officer, which led to Anita being assigned a legal aid lawyer. Both Sakhya Lawyer and the legal aid lawyer consistently followed up on the case, hoping for a resolution between Anita and her husband. Unfortunately, there was no sign of a settlement. The situation escalated when, in a fit of rage, her husband attacked Sunita with scissors, severely injuring her and necessitating hospitalization. Anita then applied to the court, citing a direct threat to her life.)
/E (In response to this ongoing abuse, Sakhya's Lawyer applied for the Protection Officer, which led to Anita being assigned a legal aid lawyer. Both Sakhya Lawyer and the legal aid lawyer consistently followed up on the case, hoping for a resolution between Anita and her husband. Unfortunately, there was no sign of a settlement. The situation escalated when, in a fit of rage, her husband attacked Sunita with scissors, severely injuring her and necessitating hospitalization. Anita then applied to the court, citing a direct threat to her life.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
277 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 137 0 R
/T (After the attack, Anita moved in with her sister, but she soon faced financial difficulties. Her husband had taken control of their shared shop and was running it without her knowledge or consent, further exacerbating her vulnerability. Uncertain about her next steps, Anita sought further legal assistance from Sakhya Lawyer.)
/E (After the attack, Anita moved in with her sister, but she soon faced financial difficulties. Her husband had taken control of their shared shop and was running it without her knowledge or consent, further exacerbating her vulnerability. Uncertain about her next steps, Anita sought further legal assistance from Sakhya Lawyer.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4]
