/P 137 0 R
/T (A year after the initial intervention, and with the continued support of both the Sakhya Lawyer and the legal aid lawyer, it was suggested that Anita apply to the court, requesting permission to return to her husband's home in order to secure her financial livelihood. The court carefully reviewed the application, and after considering all the circumstances, the judge issued an order allowing Anita to return to her husband's house.)
/E (A year after the initial intervention, and with the continued support of both the Sakhya Lawyer and the legal aid lawyer, it was suggested that Anita apply to the court, requesting permission to return to her husband's home in order to secure her financial livelihood. The court carefully reviewed the application, and after considering all the circumstances, the judge issued an order allowing Anita to return to her husband's house.)
