<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 140 0 R
/E (At Sakhya, we believe that every child deserves a chance to grow, learn, and thrive. Our summer camp and Children's Day celebration were designed to provide a fun and engaging platform for children to develop new skills, build friendships, and create lifelong memories, with a special focus on promoting gender equality. Interactive workshops on art, craft, music, and dance, promoting creativity and self-expression sports and games, promoting teamwork, physical activity, and challenging gender stereotypes, educational sessions on environmental conservation, health, and hygiene, highlighting the importance of girls' education and empowerment, inspirational talks from role models and mentors, showcasing women's achievements and contributions, distribution of gifts, snacks, and educational materials. We are committed to empowering girls and promoting gender equality. Our summer camp and Children's Day celebration were a testament to this commitment. We look forward to continuing our work with children and making a positive impact on their lives, promoting a more equitable and just society for all.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
