/E (On 19th October 2024, an exposure visit was organized for community women to the Global Vipassana Pagoda in Gorai and Muktisagar Kendra in Bhatebandar. The purpose of the visit was to provide participants with practical tools for stress relief and emotional healing through meditation and mindfulness practices. The sessions included guided meditation, relaxation techniques, and reflective group discussions. This holistic experience not only fostered emotional well-being but also promoted a sense of unity, self-awareness, and empowerment among the women, encouraging them to incorporate mental wellness practices into their daily lives.)
