<<
/Title (Anita was facing domestic violence as her husband was involved in an extramarital affair. The emotional and psychological abuse, coupled with the constant turmoil in their relationship, led her to seek help from Sakhya's Lawyer. With the support of counselling provided by Sakhya's lawyer, Anita and her husband managed to reconcile and try to live together again. However, despite their efforts, the situation deteriorated further when her husband refused to end the affair, and his behavior became more abusive and troubling.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1574 0 R
/Next 1582 0 R
>>
endobj
1581 0 obj
