/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1583 0 R
/Next 1575 0 R
>>
endobj
1582 0 obj
<<
/Title (In response to this ongoing abuse, Sakhya's Lawyer applied for the Protection Officer, which led to Anita being assigned a legal aid lawyer. Both Sakhya Lawyer and the legal aid lawyer consistently followed up on the case, hoping for a resolution between Anita and her husband. Unfortunately, there was no sign of a settlement. The situation escalated when, in a fit of rage, her husband attacked Sunita with scissors, severely injuring her and necessitating hospitalization. Anita then applied to the court, citing a direct threat to her life.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1580 0 R
/Next 1584 0 R
>>
endobj
