1584 0 obj
<<
/Title (After the attack, Anita moved in with her sister, but she soon faced financial difficulties. Her husband had taken control of their shared shop and was running it without her knowledge or consent, further exacerbating her vulnerability. Uncertain about her next steps, Anita sought further legal assistance from Sakhya Lawyer.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1582 0 R
/Next 1586 0 R
>>
endobj
