1586 0 obj
<<
/Title (A year after the initial intervention, and with the continued support of both the Sakhya Lawyer and the legal aid lawyer, it was suggested that Anita apply to the court, requesting permission to return to her husband's home in order to secure her financial livelihood. The court carefully reviewed the application, and after considering all the circumstances, the judge issued an order allowing Anita to return to her husband's house.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1584 0 R
/Next 1587 0 R
>>
endobj
1587 0 obj
<<
/Title (The case, which had been ongoing for a year, was ultimately decided in Anita's favour, with the judge ruling that she could return to her husband's home to live, in the hopes of resolving her financial difficulties.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1586 0 R
/Next 1585 0 R
>>
